        // * MATCH ON THE BASE SERIES (R4). A smoothed chart draws three traces where the caller
        // gave one -- the faded ghost "X (raw)", the bold mean "X - 20d mean", and nothing named
        // plain "X" at all. FOCUS is terminal-wide, so an exact-name match would break
