    // * A REBASED =100 PANEL IS NEVER SMOOTHED, and on these four it is not only a display
    // question: their traces carry the raw level in customdata and a hovertemplate that prints
    // "rebased X - level Y". A smoothed copy would show a MEAN next to the raw print under the
    // word "level". noSmooth removes the problem entirely.
