    // -- including the terminal-wide crosshair's -- while leaving the _xsync / _fwired flags set,
    // so wireTabSync skipped the div for the rest of the session and the sync was dead with no
    // error (CHARTS_RESTYLE.md section 10, cause B). vchart purges only when the trace count
    // actually changes, and when it does it clears those flags and re-wires the sync itself.
    vplot("plot-macro-" + p.id, traces, layout, vopts);
