    + (S ? `Click a fund house to see which of its schemes held or traded it in the months shown; on a scheme row, \u201c% of that house's book\u201d reads as that scheme's own portfolio. Schemes that never held or traded \u20b90.1 cr of it are summed in \u201cOther schemes\u201d. ` : `Scheme-by-scheme detail for this stock reaches the panel with the next nightly refresh. `)
    + `Houses below \u20b90.5 cr in every month are not carried. A merger month reads n/a rather than zero, `
    + `because the rupees traded through a share swap are genuinely unknown, not nil.</div></div>`;
  const w1 = host.querySelector(".ab-ddwrap"); if (w1 && (sl0 || st0)) { w1.scrollLeft = sl0; w1.scrollTop = st0; }
