      + (failed
        ? `<p class="empty-note">The daily track for <b>${fEsc(keyA)}</b> is listed in this build but its file would not load. That is a fault in the build, not a property of the book \u2014 please report it.</p>`
        : `<p class="empty-note">No daily track for <b>${fEsc(keyA)}</b> on the selected scheme types. We only chart a book while at least 95% of what it holds can be priced, counting back from its latest disclosure. This one falls short, usually because part of it sits in foreign shares, which our NSE prices do not cover \u2014 rather than guess at that part, we leave the chart out.</p>`);
    return;
